d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495010/extras/be13a225e89af8995cc48d6f8364b626.webm?t=1711470319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495010/extras/be13a225e89af8995cc48d6f8364b626.mp4?t=1711470319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
